{"id":"vod_bf_15142","vodId":"15142","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"假面骑士V3","name_cn":"假面骑士V3","date":"1973-01-01","year":"1973","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-16/1965fc71386eb8528a2e1156f7874341.jpg"},"summary":"由于两位假面骑士的活跃，邪恶组织·杰鲁修卡被消灭，但是首领又创建了新组织·毒蝎帮(又译“迪斯特龙”)。本乡猛的学弟·风见志郎偶然目击毒蝎帮的行动，而受到该邪恶组织的追杀，之后父母以及妹妹都被毒蝎帮的怪人所杀。志郎为了向毒蝎帮军复仇而要求1号和2号替他改造，但二人知道改造人的悲哀，而拒绝了他。后来1号和2号落入了毒蝎帮的陷阱而陷入危机，志郎舍命相救，被机关所伤而奄奄一息，为了救他一命，1号、2号不得不将他改造成改造人·假面骑士V3。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 03:56:35","playable":true,"episodeCount":52,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishiV3/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishiV3/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishiV3/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishiV3/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishiV3/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishiV3/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishiV3/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishiV3/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishiV3/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishiV3/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishiV3/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishiV3/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishiV3/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiamianqishiV3/第14集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/vid